-- A batch whose parts come in two kinds that take one shape. One rule per
-- kind fires once per part inside the batch's commit, and together they
-- answer every part. V18 counts only an answer over the batch itself.
transient act Upload { note: text } with rows
shape Row { upload: one Upload, ident: text }
shape CreateRow is Row { newKey: text }
shape UpdateRow is Row { key: text }
shape Made { key: text }
rule HandleCreate when CreateRow { Made from { key: newKey } }
rule HandleUpdate when UpdateRow { Made from { key: key } }
